add(f"Caption within-minus-between separation changes from {se['captionCosine']['rawMeanWithinMinusBetween']:.3f} to {se['captionCosine']['nuisanceResidualMeanWithinMinusBetween']:.3f} under the documented conditioning, while title separation changes from {se['titleCosine']['rawMeanWithinMinusBetween']:.3f} to {se['titleCosine']['nuisanceResidualMeanWithinMinusBetween']:.3f}. These descriptive residual comparisons do not identify causal mediation or remove speaker and editing differences.")
