 mt.append('The strict control score counts a literal marker. A base response saying ``Insufficient evidence.'' is a semantic refusal but does not match that marker; zero strict score must not be described as zero refusal. Conversely, the adapted closed-book output supplies a studio temperature of 23 degrees Celsius although no measurement evidence is provided. This concrete unsupported assertion is a substantive failure that token F1 cannot diagnose. The controls are diagnostic examples, not a representative hallucination rate.')
